            586,
            127
        ],
        "page_idx": 1
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "例 29: 设 $h(t)$ 方程中, $h(t)$ 最高阶系数为 $n$ 阶, 激励 $\\delta(t)$ 最高阶系数项为 $m$ 。",
        "bbox": [
            183,
            137,
            774,
            154
        ],
        "page_idx": 1
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "(1) $n > m$",
        "bbox": [
            184,
            162,
            268,
            178
        ],
        "page_idx": 1
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\nh ^ {\\prime \\prime} (t) + 3 h ^ {\\prime} (t) + 2 h (t) = \\delta^ {\\prime} (t) + 3 \\delta (t)\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            346,
            185,
            648,
            205
        ],
        "page_idx": 1
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "(2) $n = m$",
        "bbox": [
            184,
            347,
            268,
            365
        ],
        "page_idx": 1
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\nh ^ {\\prime \\prime} (t) + 3 h ^ {\\prime} (t) + 2 h (t) = \\delta^ {\\prime \\prime} (t) + 2 \\delta (t)\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            346,
            371,
            648,
            391
        ],
        "page_idx": 1
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\n(3) n <   m\n$$",
