    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "考点 3: 阶跃响应的求解",
        "text_level": 2,
        "bbox": [
            184,
            109,
            418,
            127
        ],
        "page_idx": 3
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "1、定义",
        "text_level": 2,
        "bbox": [
            184,
            138,
            255,
            153
        ],
        "page_idx": 3
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "以单位阶跃信号 $u(t)$ 作激励，系统产生的零状态响应称为“单位阶跃响应”或简称“阶跃响应”，以 $g(t)$ 表示。",
        "bbox": [
            184,
            162,
            811,
            203
        ],
        "page_idx": 3
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "2、阶跃响应的经典法求解",
        "bbox": [
            184,
            277,
            400,
            294
        ],
        "page_idx": 3
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "例 31: 描述某LTI系统的微分方程为",
        "bbox": [
            184,
            480,
            473,
            496
        ],
        "page_idx": 3
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\n\\frac {d ^ {2} r (t)}{d t ^ {2}} + 5 \\frac {d r (t)}{d t} + 6 r (t) = 3 \\frac {d e (t)}{d t} + 2 e (t)\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            329,
            503,
            665,
            538
        ],
        "page_idx": 3
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "试求其阶跃响应 $g(t)$ 。",
        "bbox": [
            184,
            543,
            357,
            559
        ],
        "page_idx": 3
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "官网：tongxinkaoyan.com",
        "bbox": [
            159,
            881,
            371,
            897
        ],
        "page_idx": 3
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
