            71
        ],
        "page_idx": 4
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "例 32: 若激励为 $e(t)$ , 响应 $r(t)$ 的 LTI 系统的微分方程由下式描述, 求系统的阶跃响应 $g(t)$ 。",
        "bbox": [
            181,
            109,
            811,
            150
        ],
        "page_idx": 4
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\n\\frac {d r (t)}{d t} + 2 r (t) = \\frac {d ^ {2} e (t)}{d t ^ {2}} + 3 \\frac {d e (t)}{d t} + 3 e (t)\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            334,
            157,
            658,
            192
        ],
        "page_idx": 4
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "3、LTIS下微积分求解法",
        "text_level": 2,
        "bbox": [
            184,
            463,
            381,
            479
        ],
        "page_idx": 4
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "由于单位阶跃函数 $u(t)$ 与单位冲激函数 $\\delta(t)$ 的关系为",
        "bbox": [
            184,
            488,
            594,
            503
        ],
        "page_idx": 4
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\n\\delta (t) = \\frac {d u (t)}{d t}, u (t) = \\int_ {- \\infty} ^ {t} \\delta (x) d x\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            359,
            511,
            636,
            546
        ],
        "page_idx": 4
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "根据LTI系统的微(积)分特性,同一系统的阶跃响应与冲激响应的关系为",
        "bbox": [
            184,
            553,
            751,
            568
        ],
        "page_idx": 4
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\nh (t) = \\frac {d g (t)}{d t}, g (t) = \\int_ {- \\infty} ^ {t} h (x) d x\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            357,
            577,
            636,
            611
        ],
        "page_idx": 4
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "例：若已知 $h(t)=(-4e^{-2t}+7e^{-3t})u(t)$",
        "bbox": [
            184,
            640,
            500,
            657
        ],
        "page_idx": 4
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\n\\begin{array}{c} \\therefore g (t) = \\int_ {- \\infty} ^ {t} h (\\tau) d \\tau = \\int_ {- \\infty} ^ {t} [ - 4 e ^ {- 2 \\tau} + 7 e ^ {- 3 \\tau} ] u (\\tau) d \\tau \\\\ = \\left[ - 4 \\int_ {0} ^ {t} e ^ {- 2 \\tau} d \\tau + 7 \\int_ {0} ^ {t} e ^ {- 3 \\tau} d \\tau \\right] u (t) = \\left[ - 4 \\cdot \\frac {e ^ {- 2 \\tau}}{- 2} \\Bigg | _ {0} ^ {t} + 7 \\cdot \\frac {e ^ {- 3 \\tau}}{- 3} \\Bigg | _ {0} ^ {t} \\right] u (t) \\\\ = \\left[ 2 (e ^ {- 2 t} - 1) - \\frac {7}{3} (e ^ {- 3 t} - 1) \\right] u (t) = \\left(2 e ^ {- 2 t} - \\frac {7}{3} e ^ {- 3 t} + \\frac {1}{3}\\right) u (t) \\end{array}\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            231,
            665,
            766,
            785
        ],
        "page_idx": 4
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "官网：tongxinkaoyan.com",
        "bbox": [
            157,
            881,
            371,
            897
        ],
        "page_idx": 4
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "梦马班讲义",
        "bbox": [
            739,
            881,
            836,
            897
        ],
        "page_idx": 4
    },
    {
        "type": "page_number",
        "text": "5",
        "bbox": [
