    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "考点4: $h(t)$ 与 $g(t)$ 求解总结",
        "bbox": [
            184,
            109,
            452,
            127
        ],
        "page_idx": 5
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\n\\begin{array}{r l} & {h (t) \\left\\{ \\begin{array}{l l} {\\text {非常规方程：定义法}} \\\\ {\\text {线性常系数微分方程} \\left\\{ \\begin{array}{l l} {\\text {经典法}} \\\\ {L T \\text {法}} \\end{array} \\right.} \\end{array} \\right.} \\\\ & {\\quad g (t) =  \\int_ {- \\infty} ^ {t} h (\\tau) d \\tau   [ \\text {注意默认项} ]} \\end{array}\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            357,
            138,
            636,
            239
        ],
        "page_idx": 5
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "例 33: 一因果性的LTI系统, 其输入、输出用下列微分一积分方程表示:",
        "bbox": [
            184,
            267,
            752,
            283
        ],
        "page_idx": 5
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\n\\frac {d}{d t} r (t) + 5 r (t) = \\int_ {- \\infty} ^ {\\infty} e (\\tau) f (t - \\tau) d \\tau - e (t)\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            322,
            290,
            670,
            326
        ],
        "page_idx": 5
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "其中 $f(t)=e^{-t}u(t)+3\\delta(t)$ ，求该系统的单位冲激响应 $h(t)$ 。",
        "bbox": [
            184,
            331,
            655,
            347
        ],
        "page_idx": 5
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "官网：tongxinkaoyan.com",
        "bbox": [
            157,
            882,
            371,
            897
